<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TeleTech rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TeleTech rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it intiated coverage of TeleTech Holdings Inc with a buy rating, and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $0.46 per share for 1997 and $0.75 for 1998 versus $0.24 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- set near-term price target of $28. Shares gained 3/8 to 18-1/4.</p>
</text>
